    "Registers a free WARP device with Cloudflare over MASQUE. By registering you accept [Cloudflare's terms](https://www.cloudflare.com/application/terms/). While connected, Cloudflare is asked through the proxy." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fa" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "یک دستگاه رایگان WARP با MASQUE در Cloudflare ثبت می‌کند. با ثبت، [شرایط Cloudflare](https://www.cloudflare.com/application/terms/) را می‌پذیرید. وقتی متصل هستید، درخواست از طریق پراکسی به Cloudflare می‌رود."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Регистрирует бесплатное устройство WARP в Cloudflare по MASQUE. Регистрируясь, вы принимаете [условия Cloudflare](https://www.cloudflare.com/application/terms/). При подключении запрос к Cloudflare идёт через прокси."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Cloudflare 注册一个使用 MASQUE 的免费 WARP 设备。注册即表示你接受 [Cloudflare 的条款](https://www.cloudflare.com/application/terms/)。连接时，将通过代理访问 Cloudflare。"
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يسجل جهاز WARP مجانيًا لدى Cloudflare عبر MASQUE. بالتسجيل تقبل [شروط Cloudflare](https://www.cloudflare.com/application/terms/). أثناء الاتصال، يُطلب Cloudflare عبر الوكيل."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Registers free WARP device với Cloudflare over MASQUE. By registering you accept [Cloudflare's terms](https://www.cloudflare.com/application/terms/). While connected, Cloudflare là asked qua proxy."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Cloudflare 註冊一個使用 MASQUE 的免費 WARP 設備。註冊即表示你接受 [Cloudflare 的條款](https://www.cloudflare.com/application/terms/)。連線時，將通過代理訪問 Cloudflare。"
          }
        },
        "my" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MASQUE မှတစ်ဆင့် Cloudflare တွင် အခမဲ့ WARP စက် မှတ်ပုံတင်သည်။ မှတ်ပုံတင်ခြင်းဖြင့် [Cloudflare ၏ စည်းကမ်းချက်များ](https://www.cloudflare.com/application/terms/) ကို သဘောတူသည်။ ချိတ်ဆက်ထားစဉ် Cloudflare သို့ ပရောက်စီမှတစ်ဆင့် တောင်းဆိုသည်။"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MASQUE üzerinden Cloudflare'e ücretsiz WARP aygıtı kaydeder. Kaydolarak [Cloudflare koşullarını](https://www.cloudflare.com/application/terms/) kabul edersiniz. Bağlıyken Cloudflare'e proxy üzerinden ulaşılır."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enregistre gratuitement un appareil WARP auprès de Cloudflare via MASQUE. En vous inscrivant, vous acceptez les [conditions de Cloudflare](https://www.cloudflare.com/application/terms/). Pendant la connexion, les requêtes à Cloudflare passent par le proxy."
          }
        },
        "ur" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MASQUE کے ذریعے Cloudflare پر مفت WARP آلہ رجسٹر کرتا ہے۔ رجسٹریشن سے آپ [Cloudflare کی شرائط](https://www.cloudflare.com/application/terms/) قبول کرتے ہیں۔ کنکشن قائم ہونے پر Cloudflare سے پراکسی کے ذریعے رابطہ کیا جاتا ہے۔"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Regista um dispositivo WARP gratuito na Cloudflare através de MASQUE. Ao registar, aceita os [termos da Cloudflare](https://www.cloudflare.com/application/terms/). Enquanto houver uma conexão ativa, as solicitações à Cloudflare são feitas através do proxy."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Registriert ein kostenloses WARP-Gerät bei Cloudflare über MASQUE. Mit der Registrierung akzeptieren Sie [Cloudflares Bedingungen](https://www.cloudflare.com/application/terms/). Bei bestehender Verbindung wird Cloudflare über den Proxy angefragt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
